        "String_ID": "STR_LINK_SKETCH_DEFINE_015",
        "String_No": "5701648"
      },
      "jp": "愛央のタレントポイントが異常な値になる現象が発生している^00ため、正常な値に修正いたします。^00 ^00それに伴い、愛央のタレント取得状態とフラグメント装着状態を^00リセットいたします。^00 ^00お手数ですが、再度タレントの取得、フラグメントの装着を^00お願いいたします。",
      "en_original": "Because there was an issue in which the value for Ao's Talent Points was incorrect, we will fix the game in order to apply the correct value.^00 ^00Accordingly, Ao's learnt Talents and attached Fragments will be reset.^00 ^00We apologize for the inconvenience, but please re-learn and re-attach the corresponding Talents and Fragments.",
      "en_auxiliary": "Because there was an issue in which the value for Ao's Talent Points was incorrect, we will fix the game in order to apply the correct value.^00 ^00Accordingly, Ao's learnt Talents and attached Fragments will be reset.^00 ^00We apologize for the inconvenience, but please re-learn and re-attach the corresponding Talents and Fragments.",
      "en": "An issue caused Ao's Talent Points to display an incorrect value.^00We will correct them to the proper value.^00 ^00As a result, Ao's learned Talents and equipped Fragments^00will be reset.^00 ^00We apologize for the inconvenience.^00Please relearn her Talents and re-equip her Fragments.",
      "alignment": {
        "status": "exact_string_no",
        "initial_en_source": "official_en",
        "official_en_index": 12,
